# production
#
# Anchored to the repo root. Unanchored `build/` matches a directory named
# `build` at ANY depth, which silently swallowed two directories of source —
# src/app/games/[gameId]/build and src/components/game/build — and reported a
# clean working tree while doing it. The deploy went out without the whole
# lineup-building flow, and the only symptom was a 404 in production.
/build/
/dist/

